1
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,200
A castle,

2
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,960
a group of children.

3
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:52,640
Secrets hidden for too long.

4
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:59,120
The truth turned upside down.

5
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:04,880
The bad guys have been seen through.

6
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,600
A shadow comes

7
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,080
for revenge.

8
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,720
Mr. Dai,

9
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:27,570
is this really the only way down the mountain and off the island?

10
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,079
It's the only way.

11
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,620
None of you can escape.

12
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:45,360
By the way, Sophie said you know some secret about Mala.

13
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,680
Tell me about it.

14
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,760
If it's a good story,

15
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,490
we should cash in on it quickly.

16
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,240
No need.

17
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:57,840
Those who are good at writing are not good at talking.

18
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,280
What's so hard to say?

19
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:02,120
Just make up Mala's experiences to be as mysterious as possible.

20
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,520
Mala died a long time ago.

21
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,440
What experiences could he have?

22
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,240
What if he's not dead?

23
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:16,640
What if he's not dead and comes to ask you for royalties?

24
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,090
These are all potential risks.

25
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,560
So...

26
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,480
You must be careful about this signing.

27
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,880
He disappeared.

28
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:33,960
Disappeared into the gap between cosmic logic and paradox.

29
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,720
That's great.

30
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,520
From my perspective,

31
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,240
Mala is dead.

32
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:45,520
Really dead.

33
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,280
Worse than death.

34
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,560
His death,

35
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:58,320
does it have anything to do with you?

36
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,610
You're afraid he'll come for revenge.

37
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,800
If he weren't so weak,

38
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,440
maybe nothing would have happened.

39
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,680
I can't be like him.

40
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,160
I thought of a good story.

41
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,839
Someone killed Mala,

42
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,960
and then faked his disappearance.

43
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,600
But tonight,

44
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,360
he suddenly appeared again,

45
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,320
and then killed

46
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,080
the rest of you.

47
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:36,640
The bad guy has been seen through.

48
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,720
That shadow,

49
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,600
coming for revenge.

50
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,540
I never wrote this last sentence in the book.

51
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:50,080
How did you know?

52
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,159
I'm sorry.

53
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:06,800
What's wrong?

54
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,600
Please help take care of Mr. Dai.

55
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,080
It's fine.

56
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:12,840
It's okay.

57
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:15,080
Xiaotao, come up and help me quickly.

58
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,080
Okay, I'm coming.

59
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,360
Don't run.

60
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,920
Come out. I see you.

61
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,360
Come out if you have the guts.

62
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,890
If there are more than five people,

63
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:48,440
the killer...

64
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,520
How did you end up like this?

65
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,920
I saw him with my own eyes.

66
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,760
There is a sixth person.

67
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,940
What nonsense are you talking about?

68
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,160
Act normal.

69
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,880
Believe me.

70
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,560
He's coming for me.

71
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,680
You don't need to take risks with me.

72
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,720
I can't drag you down.

73
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,850
If you don't want to see me, just say so.

74
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,050
There's no need to put on an act.

75
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,960
You can't go alone anymore.

76
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,840
Let's go together, the five of us, okay?

77
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:28,320
Wait for me a moment.

78
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,580
I'll go get the others.

79
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:34,000
Actually, I left alone back then

80
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,800
not because I didn't love you,

81
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:38,640
but because seeing you would remind me of him.

82
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,080
His death

83
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,760
was a fatal blow to both of us.

84
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:47,680
It's only natural that you don't want to see me.

85
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,120
When did I ever not want to see you?

86
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,159
Even friends think of each other.

87
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:54,840
We loved each other and lived together for seven years. I...

88
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,640
Can we not talk about this right now?

89
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,800
It's really urgent.

90
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,730
Danger could happen at any moment.

91
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,720
I'm sorry.

92
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,880
I was too anxious.

93
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,920
Your life didn't have to be

94
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,170
filled with such hardship,

95
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,180
distress, and embarrassment because of me.

96
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:17,500
You could have lived a carefree life.

97
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,480
Trust me.

98
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,320
Let the five of us leave together, okay?

99
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:22,920
Wait a moment.

100
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,180
I'll go get the others.

101
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,159
Why are you here again?

102
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:42,200
I... I saw a ghost.

103
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,280
Mr. Dai, what happened to your face?

104
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,800
No, no, no. Don't come any closer.

105
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,600
I'm sorry.

106
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,880
Please don't hit me anymore.

107
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,920
I'll leave right now.

108
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,600
When did I hit you?

109
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,159
I'll leave right now.

110
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:51,440
Was it the guy in the helmet?

111
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:51,920
I'll get out of here.

112
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,520
Li Zhiwei.

113
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,960
Where did you see him?

114
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,080
Uncle Dai.

115
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,560
Mr. Dai.

116
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:11,410
Are we just going to let Uncle Dai keep driving like this?

117
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,680
If the mountain road is really closed,

118
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,160
he will definitely turn back,

119
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,720
unless he knows another way.

120
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:18,560
What exactly is the danger you mentioned?

121
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,200
Uncle Dai said you hit him.

122
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,080
I was just with you.

123
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,410
How could I have hit him?

124
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:27,600
There's only one hour left.

125
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,560
We don't have much time.

126
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,520
Wait for me a moment.

127
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:31,250
I'll go get Xiaotao and Sophie.

128
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,840
Why is the contract here?

129
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:20,720
Mommy brought your favorite toy.

130
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,480
You won't be lonely anymore.

131
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:27,960
And him.

132
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,780
I will never let him...

133
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,600
I will never let him leave us,

134
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,360
let alone abandon us to love someone else.

135
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:36,920
Xiaotao.

136
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,400
Xiaotao.
